            "content": "<ul><li>Get smoother, firmer, brighter-looking neck and décolletage skin with consistent treatment. One-time cost investment of the Neck & Décolletage LED Device means unlimited treatments, with no ongoing payments or hassle of attending in-clinic appointments.</li></ul>",
            "code": ""
          }
        },
